  "headline": "Mesna is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale East has 22.4 days on hand and Corvale General has 15.7 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show mesna is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 73 vials of mesna 100 mg/mL 10 mL at 3.3 vials per day, providing 22.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 43 vials of the same presentation at 2.7 vials per day, providing 15.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Sagent Pharmaceuticals, which is also not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sagent Pharmaceuticals' plant is listed as SAGENT PHARMS INC.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternative manufacturers Bamboo US Bidco LCC and Baxter Healthcare Company are not on the shortage list but their labels name no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D5", "D6"]
    }
